    <div begin="00:13.330" end="03:34.520">
      <p begin="00:13.330" end="00:14.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:13.330" end="00:13.460">行</span><span begin="00:13.540" end="00:13.690">か</span><span begin="00:13.780" end="00:13.930">な</span><span begin="00:13.930" end="00:14.180">い</span><span begin="00:14.180" end="00:14.700">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要离开</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不要離開</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don't go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가지 마</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne pars pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No te vayas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Geh nicht fort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não vá embora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не уходи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non andare via</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ikanaide</span></p>
      <p begin="00:16.310" end="00:17.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:16.310" end="00:16.520">こ</span><span begin="00:16.520" end="00:16.720">れ</span><span begin="00:16.720" end="00:16.940">以</span><span begin="00:16.940" end="00:17.410">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再也不要</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">再也不要</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Not any farther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">더 이상</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pas davantage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No dejes que</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nicht noch weiter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прошу больше не надо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non lasciare che</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kore ijou</span></p>
      <p begin="00:18.010" end="00:19.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:18.010" end="00:18.250">散</span><span begin="00:18.250" end="00:18.470">っ</span><span begin="00:18.470" end="00:18.590">て</span><span begin="00:18.670" end="00:18.810">か</span><span begin="00:18.920" end="00:19.080">な</span><span begin="00:19.080" end="00:19.330">い</span><span begin="00:19.330" end="00:19.540">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样渐渐消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就這樣漸漸消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don't scatter and fade away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">흩어져 사라지지 마</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne te dissipe pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Te desvanezcas aún más</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verweh nicht noch mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não vá se dissipando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не исчезай по крупицам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tutto si disperda ancora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Chitte kanaide</span></p>
      <p begin="00:19.930" end="00:21.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:19.930" end="00:20.380">笑</span><span begin="00:20.380" end="00:20.500">わ</span><span begin="00:20.610" end="00:20.830">な</span><span begin="00:20.830" end="00:21.030">い</span><span begin="00:21.030" end="00:21.540">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再笑了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">別再笑了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don't smile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">웃지 마</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne ris pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No te rías</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lach nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não sorria</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не улыбайся</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non sorridere</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Warawanaide</span></p>
      <p begin="00:23.180" end="00:24.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:23.180" end="00:23.380">こ</span><span begin="00:23.380" end="00:23.590">れ</span><span begin="00:23.590" end="00:23.800">以</span><span begin="00:23.800" end="00:24.280">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要再这样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不要再這樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Not anymore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">더 이상</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pas davantage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No sigas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nicht noch mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прошу больше не надо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non continuare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kore ijou</span></p>
      <p begin="00:24.900" end="00:26.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:24.900" end="00:25.020">戸</span><span begin="00:25.120" end="00:25.540">惑</span><span begin="00:25.540" end="00:25.630">わ</span><span begin="00:25.720" end="00:26.070">せ</span><span begin="00:26.210" end="00:26.400">な</span><span begin="00:26.400" end="00:26.610">い</span><span begin="00:26.610" end="00:26.800">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我心乱如麻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我心亂如麻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don't leave me so confused</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 혼란스럽게 하지 마</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne me trouble pas davantage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Desconcertándome aún más</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bring mich nicht weiter durcheinander</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não me deixe ainda mais confusa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не заставляй меня теряться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">A confondermi così</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tomadowasenaide</span></p>
      <p begin="00:27.020" end="00:30.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:27.020" end="00:27.390">夢</span><span begin="00:27.490" end="00:27.800">の</span><span begin="00:27.900" end="00:28.190">中</span><span begin="00:28.320" end="00:28.460">も</span> <span begin="00:28.730" end="00:28.960">リ</span><span begin="00:28.960" end="00:29.180">ア</span><span begin="00:29.180" end="00:29.600">ル</span><span begin="00:29.600" end="00:29.820">な</span><span begin="00:29.820" end="00:30.030">の</span><span begin="00:30.030" end="00:30.200">妙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连梦中也如此真实 真是不可思议</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就連夢中也如此真實 真是不可思議</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even in my dreams it feels strangely real</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">꿈속마저 현실처럼 느껴지는 게 묘해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même dans mes rêves tout paraît réel c'est étrange</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hasta en mis sueños todo parece real qué extraño</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst im Traum fühlt sich alles seltsam echt an</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até nos sonhos tudo parece real que estranho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже во сне всё странно по-настоящему</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche nei sogni sembra tutto reale che strano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yume no naka mo riaru na no myou</span></p>
      <p begin="00:30.470" end="00:32.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:30.470" end="00:30.700">気</span><span begin="00:30.700" end="00:30.840">に</span><span begin="00:30.920" end="00:31.210">な</span><span begin="00:31.210" end="00:31.330">っ</span><span begin="00:31.330" end="00:31.550">て</span><span begin="00:31.550" end="00:31.740">仕</span><span begin="00:31.740" end="00:32.090">方</span><span begin="00:32.180" end="00:32.360">な</span><span begin="00:32.360" end="00:32.620">い</span><span begin="00:32.620" end="00:32.990">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我无论如何都无法释怀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我無論如何都無法釋懷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I just can't get you out of my mind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">자꾸만 신경 쓰여 어쩔 수가 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne peux pas m'empêcher d'y penser</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No puedo dejar de pensar en ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du gehst mir einfach nicht aus dem Kopf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não consigo parar de pensar em você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не могу перестать думать о тебе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non riesco a smettere di pensarci</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ki ni natte shikata nai yo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:34.480" end="00:35.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:34.480" end="00:34.730">何</span><span begin="00:34.730" end="00:34.840">も</span><span begin="00:34.840" end="00:34.950">か</span><span begin="00:34.950" end="00:35.140">も</span> <span begin="00:35.140" end="00:35.250">日</span><span begin="00:35.250" end="00:35.380">々</span><span begin="00:35.380" end="00:35.490">と</span><span begin="00:35.490" end="00:35.600">か</span><span begin="00:35.600" end="00:35.720">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论一切 甚至那些平凡的日常</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論一切 甚至那些平凡的日常</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Everything even my everyday life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 무엇도 하루하루의 일상마저도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout absolument tout même mon quotidien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo lo demás incluso mis días</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Alles selbst die Tage meines Lebens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tudo até os dias que vivo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всё на свете даже прожитые дни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni cosa persino i giorni che passano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nani mo kamo hibi toka mo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:35.800" end="00:38.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:35.800" end="00:35.920">投</span><span begin="00:35.920" end="00:36.010">げ</span><span begin="00:36.010" end="00:36.140">捨</span><span begin="00:36.140" end="00:36.250">て</span><span begin="00:36.250" end="00:36.360">て</span> <span begin="00:36.440" end="00:36.860">君</span><span begin="00:36.860" end="00:36.980">を</span><span begin="00:37.060" end="00:37.330">知</span><span begin="00:37.330" end="00:37.450">り</span><span begin="00:37.530" end="00:37.800">た</span><span begin="00:37.800" end="00:38.270">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都想尽数抛开 只为更加了解你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">都想盡數拋開 只為更加了解你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I'd throw it all away just to know you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모두 내던지고 너를 알고 싶어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je voudrais tout abandonner pour te connaître</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quiero dejarlo atrás para conocerte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Will ich fortwerfen nur um dich kennenzulernen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quero deixar para trás só para conhecer você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Хочу отбросить лишь бы узнать тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vorrei gettare via tutto per conoscerti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nagesutete kimi o shiritai</span></p>
      <p begin="00:39.030" end="00:40.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:39.030" end="00:39.250">可</span><span begin="00:39.250" end="00:39.370">笑</span><span begin="00:39.480" end="00:39.710">し</span><span begin="00:39.710" end="00:39.920">い</span><span begin="00:39.920" end="00:40.590">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真是可笑呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">真是可笑呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Funny isn't it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우습지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C'est absurde n'est-ce pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Qué absurdo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schon seltsam nicht wahr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que coisa estranha não é</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забавно правда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che assurdo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Okashii ne</span></p>
      <p begin="00:41.400" end="00:47.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:41.400" end="00:41.650">名</span><span begin="00:42.050" end="00:42.940">前</span><span begin="00:43.310" end="00:43.560">を</span><span begin="00:43.910" end="00:44.230">そ</span><span begin="00:44.390" end="00:44.690">ば</span><span begin="00:44.810" end="00:46.220">で</span><span begin="00:46.700" end="00:46.820">呼</span><span begin="00:46.820" end="00:46.960">ん</span><span begin="00:46.960" end="00:47.160">で</span><span begin="00:47.160" end="00:47.280">み</span><span begin="00:47.280" end="00:47.510">な</span><span begin="00:47.510" end="00:47.620">い？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不试着在我身旁 轻声唤我的名字吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不試著在我身旁 輕聲喚我的名字嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Won't you try calling my name by my side?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">곁에서 이름을 불러 보지 않을래?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et si on essayait de s'appeler par nos noms tout près l'un de l'autre ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Y si intento pronunciar tu nombre a tu lado?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Soll ich deinen Namen mal ganz in deiner Nähe rufen?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que tal me chamar pelo nome bem de perto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Может попробовать позвать тебя по имени когда ты рядом?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché non proviamo a chiamarci per nome da vicino?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Namae o soba de yonde minai?</span></p>
      <p begin="00:48.220" end="00:51.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:48.220" end="00:48.650">純</span><span begin="00:48.650" end="00:48.870">な</span><span begin="00:48.870" end="00:49.310">感</span><span begin="00:49.310" end="00:49.730">情</span><span begin="00:49.730" end="00:50.160">か</span><span begin="00:50.160" end="00:50.380">ら</span><span begin="00:50.380" end="00:50.660">ま</span><span begin="00:50.660" end="00:50.810">っ</span><span begin="00:50.810" end="00:51.210">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纯粹的情愫纠缠不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">純粹的情愫糾纏不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Pure feelings all tangled up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">순수한 감정이 뒤엉키고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mes sentiments les plus purs s'emmêlent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los sentimientos más puros se enredan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unverfälschte Gefühle verheddern sich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sentimentos puros se entrelaçam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чистые чувства переплелись</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I sentimenti più puri si aggrovigliano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jun na kanjou karamatte</span></p>
      <p begin="00:51.660" end="00:54.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:51.660" end="00:52.080">大</span><span begin="00:52.080" end="00:52.740">切</span><span begin="00:52.740" end="00:52.920">が</span><span begin="00:53.160" end="00:53.800">合</span><span begin="00:53.800" end="00:54.070">間</span><span begin="00:54.070" end="00:54.240">っ</span><span begin="00:54.240" end="00:54.590">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍视的心意也交织其中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">珍視的心意也交織其中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">With everything precious caught in between</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소중한 마음까지 한데 얽혀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ce qui m'est cher vient s'y mêler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y lo más preciado se entremezcla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und alles was mir kostbar ist mischt sich darunter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E tudo o que é precioso se mistura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё дорогое сердцу вплелось в них</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E ciò che mi è caro si intreccia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Taisetsu ga aimatte</span></p>
      <p begin="00:54.890" end="00:57.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:54.890" end="00:55.080">何</span><span begin="00:55.080" end="00:55.320">処</span><span begin="00:55.320" end="00:55.530">へ</span><span begin="00:55.530" end="00:55.730">向</span><span begin="00:55.730" end="00:56.010">か</span><span begin="00:56.010" end="00:56.170">え</span><span begin="00:56.170" end="00:56.600">ば</span><span begin="00:56.600" end="00:57.020">良い</span><span begin="00:57.020" end="00:57.450">の</span><span begin="00:57.450" end="00:57.780">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟该往何处前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟該往何處前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I don't know which way I should go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어디로 향해야 하는지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne sais plus vers où me diriger</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sin saber hacia dónde debería ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wohin soll ich mich nur wenden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para onde devo seguir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Куда же мне теперь идти</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non so più verso dove andare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doko e mukaeba ii no ka</span></p>
      <p begin="00:58.070" end="01:01.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:58.070" end="00:58.210">行</span><span begin="00:58.300" end="00:58.680">方</span><span begin="00:58.930" end="00:59.180">不</span><span begin="00:59.180" end="01:00.030">明</span><span begin="01:00.030" end="01:00.330">な</span><span begin="01:00.450" end="01:00.880">ま</span><span begin="01:00.880" end="01:01.370">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至今仍迷失了方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">至今仍迷失了方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Still lost without a trace</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여전히 갈 곳을 잃은 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Toujours perdue sans savoir où aller</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigo sin encontrar el rumbo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Noch immer ohne jede Richtung</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Continuo sem rumo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так и оставаясь потерянной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Resto senza una direzione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yukue fumei na mama</span></p>
      <p begin="01:01.730" end="01:04.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:01.730" end="01:01.830">だ</span><span begin="01:01.930" end="01:02.400">か</span><span begin="01:02.400" end="01:02.620">ら</span><span begin="01:02.620" end="01:03.010">愛</span><span begin="01:03.010" end="01:03.450">想</span><span begin="01:03.450" end="01:03.860">振</span><span begin="01:03.860" end="01:04.000">り</span><span begin="01:04.110" end="01:04.360">ま</span><span begin="01:04.360" end="01:04.440">い</span><span begin="01:04.520" end="01:04.920">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是只能四处强颜欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">於是只能四處強顏歡笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So I keep putting on a friendly smile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서 애써 싹싹하게 굴고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors je distribue des sourires de façade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por eso reparto sonrisas de cortesía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Darum lächle ich allen gefällig zu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por isso distribuo sorrisos de fachada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поэтому я расточаю любезности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così dispenso sorrisi di circostanza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dakara aisou furimaite</span></p>
      <p begin="01:05.150" end="01:08.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:05.150" end="01:05.390">そ</span><span begin="01:05.390" end="01:05.590">れ</span><span begin="01:05.590" end="01:05.820">じゃ</span><span begin="01:05.820" end="01:06.030">気</span><span begin="01:06.030" end="01:06.440">持</span><span begin="01:06.440" end="01:06.660">ち</span><span begin="01:06.660" end="01:07.300">伝</span><span begin="01:07.300" end="01:07.430">わ</span><span begin="01:07.430" end="01:07.530">ん</span><span begin="01:07.530" end="01:07.790">な</span><span begin="01:07.790" end="01:07.940">い</span><span begin="01:07.940" end="01:08.340">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可这样终究无法传达心意呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可這樣終究無法傳達心意呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">But that won't get my feelings across will it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서는 마음이 전해지지 않겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais ainsi mes sentiments ne peuvent pas t'atteindre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero así mis sentimientos no llegan hasta ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch so kommen meine Gefühle nicht bei dir an</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas assim meus sentimentos não chegam até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но так мои чувства до тебя не дойдут</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma così i miei sentimenti non arrivano a te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore ja kimochi tsutawannai ne</span></p>
      <p begin="01:08.790" end="01:11.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:08.790" end="01:09.170">ああ</span> <span begin="01:09.250" end="01:09.440">ま</span><span begin="01:09.440" end="01:09.690">た</span><span begin="01:09.690" end="01:10.120">や</span><span begin="01:10.120" end="01:10.310">る</span><span begin="01:10.310" end="01:10.520">せ</span><span begin="01:10.520" end="01:10.770">な</span><span begin="01:10.770" end="01:11.170">い</span><span begin="01:11.170" end="01:11.630">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 又是这般无可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 又是這般無可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah here comes that helpless feeling again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 또다시 이 답답함만 남아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah encore cette amère impuissance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah otra vez esta amarga impotencia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ach wieder bleibt nur dieses Gefühl der Ohnmacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah mais uma vez essa angústia sem saída</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах снова эта безысходная тоска</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah di nuovo questa malinconia senza rimedio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa mata yarusenai ya</span></p>
      <p begin="01:12.000" end="01:17.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:12.000" end="01:12.550">今日</span><span begin="01:12.660" end="01:13.090">も</span><span begin="01:13.090" end="01:13.430">変</span><span begin="01:13.530" end="01:13.930">わ</span><span begin="01:13.930" end="01:14.380">ら</span><span begin="01:14.380" end="01:14.600">な</span><span begin="01:14.600" end="01:14.810">い</span><span begin="01:14.810" end="01:15.150">ま</span><span begin="01:15.240" end="01:17.370">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天也依旧一成不变</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">今天也依舊一成不變</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And today nothing has changed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오늘도 변함없는 채로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Aujourd'hui encore rien n'a changé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hoy todo sigue igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch heute bleibt alles unverändert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Hoje também tudo continua igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И сегодня всё без перемен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche oggi tutto rimane com'è</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kyou mo kawaranai mama</span></p>
      <p begin="01:21.910" end="01:23.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:21.910" end="01:22.230">ねえ、</span><span begin="01:22.360" end="01:22.520">な</span><span begin="01:22.520" end="01:22.760">ん</span><span begin="01:22.760" end="01:23.290">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 为什么呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">吶 為什麼呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Hey why</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">있잖아 어째서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dis-moi pourquoi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oye ¿por qué?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sag warum nur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ei por quê</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скажи почему</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ehi perché</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nee, nande</span></p>
      <p begin="01:24.870" end="01:28.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:24.870" end="01:25.060">揺</span><span begin="01:25.060" end="01:25.340">さ</span><span begin="01:25.340" end="01:25.530">ぶ</span><span begin="01:25.530" end="01:25.770">ら</span><span begin="01:25.770" end="01:26.110">れ</span><span begin="01:26.600" end="01:26.760">て</span><span begin="01:26.840" end="01:27.040">い</span><span begin="01:27.040" end="01:27.240">る</span><span begin="01:27.240" end="01:28.130">心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这颗心总是被你牵动</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這顆心總是被你牽動</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Is my heart being shaken like this</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마음이 이렇게 흔들리는 걸까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mon cœur est-il si bouleversé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mi corazón está tan agitado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ist mein Herz so aufgewühlt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Meu coração está tão abalado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Моё сердце так мечется</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il mio cuore continua a vacillare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yusaburarete iru kokoro</span></p>
      <p begin="01:28.520" end="01:30.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:28.520" end="01:28.960">開</span><span begin="01:28.960" end="01:29.070">か</span><span begin="01:29.160" end="01:29.360">な</span><span begin="01:29.360" end="01:29.610">い</span><span begin="01:29.610" end="01:30.080">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请先别将它打开</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請先別將它打開</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don't open it yet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">열지 말아 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne l'ouvre pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No te abras todavía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Öffne es noch nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não o abra ainda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не раскрывай его</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non aprirlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hirakanaide</span></p>
      <p begin="01:31.720" end="01:32.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:31.720" end="01:31.810">こ</span><span begin="01:31.810" end="01:31.950">っ</span><span begin="01:31.950" end="01:32.160">ち</span><span begin="01:32.160" end="01:32.390">は</span><span begin="01:32.390" end="01:32.520">ま</span><span begin="01:32.600" end="01:32.850">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我这边</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為我這邊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I'm still not ready</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">난 아직</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">De mon côté il me faut encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque yo aún</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich für meinen Teil brauche noch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque eu ainda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведь мне пока</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché io invece ho ancora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kocchi wa mada</span></p>
      <p begin="01:33.450" end="01:35.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:33.450" end="01:33.570">時</span><span begin="01:33.660" end="01:33.880">間</span><span begin="01:33.880" end="01:34.100">が</span><span begin="01:34.100" end="01:34.230">か</span><span begin="01:34.330" end="01:34.610">か</span><span begin="01:34.610" end="01:34.700">る</span><span begin="01:34.780" end="01:35.020">の</span><span begin="01:35.180" end="01:35.360">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还需要多一点时间</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">還需要多一點時間</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I need a little more time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시간이 좀 더 필요하니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un peu de temps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Necesito algo más de tiempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Etwas mehr Zeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Preciso de mais tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Нужно ещё немного времени</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Bisogno di tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jikan ga kakaru no de</span></p>
      <p begin="01:35.590" end="01:41.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:35.590" end="01:35.950">君</span><span begin="01:36.040" end="01:36.920">の</span><span begin="01:37.320" end="01:37.740">声</span><span begin="01:37.740" end="01:38.030">ば</span><span begin="01:38.030" end="01:38.160">っ</span><span begin="01:38.160" end="01:38.530">か</span> <span begin="01:39.020" end="01:39.470">響</span><span begin="01:39.470" end="01:39.800">い</span><span begin="01:39.900" end="01:40.120">て</span><span begin="01:40.120" end="01:40.320">る</span><span begin="01:40.320" end="01:40.770">月</span><span begin="01:40.770" end="01:41.180">曜</span><span begin="01:41.180" end="01:41.690">日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星期一的时光里 回荡的尽是你的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">星期一的時光裡 迴盪的盡是你的聲音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Your voice is all that echoes through my Monday</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네 목소리만 울려 퍼지는 월요일</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un lundi où seule ta voix ne cesse de résonner</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un lunes en el que solo resuena tu voz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein Montag an dem nur deine Stimme widerhallt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma segunda-feira em que só a sua voz continua ecoando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В этот понедельник звучит лишь твой голос</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È lunedì e risuona soltanto la tua voce</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi no koe bakka hibiiteru getsuyoubi</span></p>
      <p begin="01:43.070" end="01:44.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:43.070" end="01:43.300">華</span><span begin="01:43.300" end="01:43.420">や</span><span begin="01:43.420" end="01:43.530">い</span><span begin="01:43.530" end="01:43.730">だ</span> <span begin="01:43.730" end="01:43.840">時</span><span begin="01:43.840" end="01:44.050">間</span><span begin="01:44.050" end="01:44.180">さ</span><span begin="01:44.180" end="01:44.350">え</span> <span begin="01:44.350" end="01:44.510">そ</span><span begin="01:44.510" end="01:44.570">っ</span><span begin="01:44.570" end="01:44.690">ち</span><span begin="01:44.690" end="01:44.820">の</span><span begin="01:44.820" end="01:44.950">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连那些欢欣的时刻 也被我抛在一旁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就連那些歡欣的時刻 也被我拋在一旁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even the brightest moments pushed aside</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">들뜬 시간마저 제쳐 두고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même les instants les plus joyeux je les laisse de côté</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso los momentos más radiantes quedan de lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst die schönsten Stunden lasse ich links liegen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Deixando de lado até os momentos mais radiantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже радостные мгновения остаются в стороне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ignorando perfino i momenti più splendidi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hanayaida jikan sae socchi noke</span></p>
      <p begin="01:45.020" end="01:46.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:45.020" end="01:45.470">僕</span><span begin="01:45.470" end="01:45.650">を</span><span begin="01:45.650" end="01:45.920">知</span><span begin="01:45.920" end="01:46.030">り</span><span begin="01:46.130" end="01:46.380">た</span><span begin="01:46.380" end="01:46.890">い？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你想了解我吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你想了解我嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Do you want to know me?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 알고 싶어?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu veux me connaître ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Quieres conocerme?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Willst du mich kennenlernen?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quer me conhecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Хочешь узнать меня?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vuoi conoscermi?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Boku o shiritai?</span></p>
      <p begin="01:47.570" end="01:49.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:47.570" end="01:47.740">可</span><span begin="01:47.820" end="01:47.940">笑</span><span begin="01:48.040" end="01:48.270">し</span><span begin="01:48.270" end="01:48.480">い</span><span begin="01:48.480" end="01:49.320">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真是可笑呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">真是可笑呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Funny isn't it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우습지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C'est absurde n'est-ce pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Qué absurdo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schon seltsam nicht wahr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que coisa estranha não é</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забавно правда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che assurdo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Okashii ne</span></p>
      <p begin="01:49.960" end="01:56.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:49.960" end="01:50.910">来</span><span begin="01:51.200" end="01:51.530">世</span><span begin="01:51.890" end="01:52.200">あ</span><span begin="01:52.520" end="01:52.940">た</span><span begin="01:52.940" end="01:53.280">り</span><span begin="01:53.390" end="01:54.820">で</span><span begin="01:55.280" end="01:55.750">遊</span><span begin="01:55.750" end="01:55.990">ぼ</span><span begin="01:55.990" end="01:56.200">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不如等到来世 再一起玩闹吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不如等到來世 再一起玩鬧吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let's hang out sometime in the next life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다음 생쯤에 함께 놀자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">On s'amusera ensemble dans une autre vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Juguemos en alguna vida futura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass uns irgendwann im nächsten Leben etwas unternehmen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos nos divertir em alguma outra vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Давай встретимся где-нибудь в следующей жизни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Giochiamo insieme magari nella prossima vita</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Raise atari de asobou</span></p>
      <p begin="01:56.780" end="01:59.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:56.780" end="01:57.230">純</span><span begin="01:57.230" end="01:57.430">な</span><span begin="01:57.430" end="01:57.870">感</span><span begin="01:57.870" end="01:58.300">情</span><span begin="01:58.300" end="01:58.760">か</span><span begin="01:58.760" end="01:58.960">ら</span><span begin="01:58.960" end="01:59.250">ま</span><span begin="01:59.250" end="01:59.380">っ</span><span begin="01:59.380" end="01:59.800">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纯粹的情愫纠缠不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">純粹的情愫糾纏不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Pure feelings all tangled up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">순수한 감정이 뒤엉키고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mes sentiments les plus purs s'emmêlent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los sentimientos más puros se enredan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unverfälschte Gefühle verheddern sich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sentimentos puros se entrelaçam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чистые чувства переплелись</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I sentimenti più puri si aggrovigliano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jun na kanjou karamatte</span></p>
      <p begin="02:00.230" end="02:03.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:00.230" end="02:00.650">大</span><span begin="02:00.650" end="02:01.320">切</span><span begin="02:01.320" end="02:01.490">が</span><span begin="02:01.730" end="02:02.360">合</span><span begin="02:02.360" end="02:02.640">間</span><span begin="02:02.640" end="02:02.800">っ</span><span begin="02:02.800" end="02:03.180">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍视的心意也交织其中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">珍視的心意也交織其中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">With everything precious caught in between</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소중한 마음까지 한데 얽혀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ce qui m'est cher vient s'y mêler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y lo más preciado se entremezcla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und alles was mir kostbar ist mischt sich darunter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E tudo o que é precioso se mistura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё дорогое сердцу вплелось в них</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E ciò che mi è caro si intreccia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Taisetsu ga aimatte</span></p>
      <p begin="02:03.450" end="02:06.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:03.450" end="02:03.650">何</span><span begin="02:03.650" end="02:03.880">処</span><span begin="02:03.880" end="02:04.110">へ</span><span begin="02:04.110" end="02:04.300">向</span><span begin="02:04.300" end="02:04.580">か</span><span begin="02:04.580" end="02:04.740">え</span><span begin="02:04.740" end="02:05.160">ば</span><span begin="02:05.160" end="02:05.610">良い</span><span begin="02:05.610" end="02:06.020">の</span><span begin="02:06.020" end="02:06.300">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟该往何处前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟該往何處前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I don't know which way I should go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어디로 향해야 하는지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne sais plus vers où me diriger</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sin saber hacia dónde debería ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wohin soll ich mich nur wenden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para onde devo seguir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Куда же мне теперь идти</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non so più verso dove andare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doko e mukaeba ii no ka</span></p>
      <p begin="02:06.660" end="02:09.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:06.660" end="02:06.780">行</span><span begin="02:06.870" end="02:07.250">方</span><span begin="02:07.500" end="02:07.750">不</span><span begin="02:07.750" end="02:08.600">明</span><span begin="02:08.600" end="02:08.890">な</span><span begin="02:09.010" end="02:09.450">ま</span><span begin="02:09.450" end="02:09.960">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至今仍迷失了方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">至今仍迷失了方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Still lost without a trace</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여전히 갈 곳을 잃은 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Toujours perdue sans savoir où aller</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigo sin encontrar el rumbo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Noch immer ohne jede Richtung</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Continuo sem rumo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так и оставаясь потерянной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Resto senza una direzione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yukue fumei na mama</span></p>
      <p begin="02:10.330" end="02:13.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:10.330" end="02:10.410">だ</span><span begin="02:10.510" end="02:10.970">か</span><span begin="02:10.970" end="02:11.160">ら</span><span begin="02:11.160" end="02:11.590">愛</span><span begin="02:11.590" end="02:12.020">想</span><span begin="02:12.020" end="02:12.450">振</span><span begin="02:12.450" end="02:12.560">り</span><span begin="02:12.670" end="02:12.940">ま</span><span begin="02:12.940" end="02:13.010">い</span><span begin="02:13.090" end="02:13.430">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是只能四处强颜欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">於是只能四處強顏歡笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So I keep putting on a friendly smile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서 애써 싹싹하게 굴고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors je distribue des sourires de façade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por eso reparto sonrisas de cortesía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Darum lächle ich allen gefällig zu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por isso distribuo sorrisos de fachada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поэтому я расточаю любезности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così dispenso sorrisi di circostanza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dakara aisou furimaite</span></p>
      <p begin="02:13.720" end="02:16.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:13.720" end="02:13.960">そ</span><span begin="02:13.960" end="02:14.160">れ</span><span begin="02:14.160" end="02:14.390">じゃ</span><span begin="02:14.390" end="02:14.600">気</span><span begin="02:14.600" end="02:15.020">持</span><span begin="02:15.020" end="02:15.230">ち</span><span begin="02:15.230" end="02:15.870">伝</span><span begin="02:15.870" end="02:15.990">わ</span><span begin="02:15.990" end="02:16.100">ん</span><span begin="02:16.100" end="02:16.340">な</span><span begin="02:16.340" end="02:16.520">い</span><span begin="02:16.520" end="02:16.900">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可这样终究无法传达心意呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可這樣終究無法傳達心意呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">But that won't get my feelings across will it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서는 마음이 전해지지 않겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais ainsi mes sentiments ne peuvent pas t'atteindre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero así mis sentimientos no llegan hasta ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch so kommen meine Gefühle nicht bei dir an</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas assim meus sentimentos não chegam até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но так мои чувства до тебя не дойдут</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma così i miei sentimenti non arrivano a te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore ja kimochi tsutawannai ne</span></p>
      <p begin="02:17.370" end="02:20.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:17.370" end="02:17.760">ああ</span> <span begin="02:17.840" end="02:18.020">ま</span><span begin="02:18.020" end="02:18.280">た</span><span begin="02:18.280" end="02:18.670">や</span><span begin="02:18.670" end="02:18.880">る</span><span begin="02:18.880" end="02:19.110">せ</span><span begin="02:19.110" end="02:19.350">な</span><span begin="02:19.350" end="02:19.770">い</span><span begin="02:19.770" end="02:20.200">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 又是这般无可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 又是這般無可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah here comes that helpless feeling again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 또다시 이 답답함만 남아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah encore cette amère impuissance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah otra vez esta amarga impotencia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ach wieder bleibt nur dieses Gefühl der Ohnmacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah mais uma vez essa angústia sem saída</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах снова эта безысходная тоска</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah di nuovo questa malinconia senza rimedio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa mata yarusenai ya</span></p>
      <p begin="02:20.580" end="02:27.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:20.580" end="02:21.120">今日</span><span begin="02:21.230" end="02:21.660">も</span><span begin="02:21.660" end="02:22.010">変</span><span begin="02:22.090" end="02:22.540">わ</span><span begin="02:22.540" end="02:22.950">ら</span><span begin="02:22.950" end="02:23.200">な</span><span begin="02:23.200" end="02:23.400">い</span><span begin="02:23.400" end="02:23.770">ま</span><span begin="02:23.860" end="02:27.770">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天也依旧一成不变</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">今天也依舊一成不變</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And today nothing has changed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오늘도 변함없는 채로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Aujourd'hui encore rien n'a changé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hoy todo sigue igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch heute bleibt alles unverändert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Hoje também tudo continua igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И сегодня всё без перемен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche oggi tutto rimane com'è</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kyou mo kawaranai mama</span></p>
      <p begin="02:37.660" end="02:40.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:37.660" end="02:37.970">ど</span><span begin="02:37.970" end="02:38.350">う</span><span begin="02:38.350" end="02:38.520">し</span><span begin="02:38.520" end="02:38.810">た</span><span begin="02:38.810" end="02:39.270">ら</span><span begin="02:39.360" end="02:39.540">こ</span><span begin="02:39.690" end="02:40.190">の</span><span begin="02:40.190" end="02:40.810">殻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟要怎样才能将这层外壳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟要怎樣才能將這層外殼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">How could I ever break this shell</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어떻게 해야 이 껍질을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comment briser cette carapace</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Cómo podría esta coraza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie könnte ich diese Schale nur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">De que maneira esta casca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Как же мне эту скорлупу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come potrei mai questo guscio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dou shitara kono kara</span></p>
      <p begin="02:41.080" end="02:43.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="02:41.080" end="02:41.290">や</span><span begin="02:41.390" end="02:41.960">ぶ</span><span begin="02:41.960" end="02:42.240">れ</span><span begin="02:42.240" end="02:42.700">る</span><span begin="02:42.790" end="02:42.990">か</span><span begin="02:43.110" end="02:43.820">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彻底打破呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">徹底打破呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I wonder if I really can</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">깨뜨릴 수 있을까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Est-ce que j'y arriverai un jour</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Llegar a romperse?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Endlich durchbrechen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Poderia se romper</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Наконец разбить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Riuscire a spezzarlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yabureru kana</span></p>
      <p begin="02:44.520" end="02:47.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:44.520" end="02:44.830">変</span><span begin="02:44.830" end="02:45.360">わ</span><span begin="02:45.360" end="02:45.560">れ</span><span begin="02:45.650" end="02:46.210">ず</span><span begin="02:46.210" end="02:46.410">に</span><span begin="02:46.520" end="02:47.400">時</span><span begin="02:47.400" end="02:47.580">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终无法改变的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">始終無法改變的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Still unable to change while time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">변하지 못한 채 시간은</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je n'arrive pas à changer et pourtant le temps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sin conseguir cambiar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ohne dass ich mich ändern kann zieht die Zeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sem conseguir mudar eu vejo o tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не сумев измениться я вижу как время</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Senza riuscire a cambiare il tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kawarezu ni toki wa</span></p>
      <p begin="02:47.950" end="02:51.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="02:47.950" end="02:48.110">ま</span><span begin="02:48.230" end="02:48.770">た</span><span begin="02:48.770" end="02:49.100">過</span><span begin="02:49.100" end="02:49.550">ぎ</span><span begin="02:49.660" end="02:49.870">て</span><span begin="02:49.950" end="02:51.480">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能任由时光再度流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只能任由時光再度流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just keeps slipping by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">또 흘러가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Continue encore de s'écouler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El tiempo sigue pasando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schon wieder an mir vorbei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Passar mais uma vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Снова проходит мимо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continua ancora a scorrere</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mata sugiteku</span></p>
      <p begin="02:53.360" end="02:56.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="02:53.360" end="02:53.790">純</span><span begin="02:53.790" end="02:54.010">な</span><span begin="02:54.010" end="02:54.450">感</span><span begin="02:54.450" end="02:54.870">情</span><span begin="02:54.870" end="02:55.300">か</span><span begin="02:55.300" end="02:55.520">ら</span><span begin="02:55.520" end="02:55.810">ま</span><span begin="02:55.810" end="02:55.950">っ</span><span begin="02:55.950" end="02:56.380">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纯粹的情愫纠缠不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">純粹的情愫糾纏不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Pure feelings all tangled up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">순수한 감정이 뒤엉키고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mes sentiments les plus purs s'emmêlent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los sentimientos más puros se enredan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unverfälschte Gefühle verheddern sich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sentimentos puros se entrelaçam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чистые чувства переплелись</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I sentimenti più puri si aggrovigliano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jun na kanjou karamatte</span></p>
      <p begin="02:56.810" end="02:59.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="02:56.810" end="02:57.210">大</span><span begin="02:57.210" end="02:57.870">切</span><span begin="02:57.870" end="02:58.070">が</span><span begin="02:58.320" end="02:58.950">合</span><span begin="02:58.950" end="02:59.200">間</span><span begin="02:59.200" end="02:59.370">っ</span><span begin="02:59.370" end="02:59.730">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍视的心意也交织其中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">珍視的心意也交織其中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">With everything precious caught in between</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소중한 마음까지 한데 얽혀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ce qui m'est cher vient s'y mêler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y lo más preciado se entremezcla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und alles was mir kostbar ist mischt sich darunter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E tudo o que é precioso se mistura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё дорогое сердцу вплелось в них</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E ciò che mi è caro si intreccia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Taisetsu ga aimatte</span></p>
      <p begin="03:00.040" end="03:02.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="03:00.040" end="03:00.220">何</span><span begin="03:00.220" end="03:00.420">処</span><span begin="03:00.420" end="03:00.660">へ</span><span begin="03:00.660" end="03:00.850">向</span><span begin="03:00.850" end="03:01.140">か</span><span begin="03:01.140" end="03:01.320">え</span><span begin="03:01.320" end="03:01.740">ば</span><span begin="03:01.740" end="03:02.170">良い</span><span begin="03:02.170" end="03:02.590">の</span><span begin="03:02.590" end="03:02.950">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟该往何处前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟該往何處前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I don't know which way I should go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어디로 향해야 하는지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne sais plus vers où me diriger</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sin saber hacia dónde debería ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wohin soll ich mich nur wenden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para onde devo seguir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Куда же мне теперь идти</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non so più verso dove andare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doko e mukaeba ii no ka</span></p>
      <p begin="03:03.220" end="03:06.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="03:03.220" end="03:03.340">行</span><span begin="03:03.430" end="03:03.810">方</span><span begin="03:04.060" end="03:04.310">不</span><span begin="03:04.310" end="03:05.160">明</span><span begin="03:05.160" end="03:05.460">な</span><span begin="03:05.580" end="03:06.010">ま</span><span begin="03:06.010" end="03:06.540">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至今仍迷失了方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">至今仍迷失了方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Still lost without a trace</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여전히 갈 곳을 잃은 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Toujours perdue sans savoir où aller</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigo sin encontrar el rumbo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Noch immer ohne jede Richtung</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Continuo sem rumo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так и оставаясь потерянной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Resto senza una direzione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yukue fumei na mama</span></p>
      <p begin="03:06.890" end="03:10.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="03:06.890" end="03:06.990">だ</span><span begin="03:07.090" end="03:07.530">か</span><span begin="03:07.530" end="03:07.750">ら</span><span begin="03:07.750" end="03:08.130">愛</span><span begin="03:08.130" end="03:08.370">想</span><span begin="03:08.580" end="03:09.020">振</span><span begin="03:09.020" end="03:09.120">り</span><span begin="03:09.230" end="03:09.520">ま</span><span begin="03:09.520" end="03:09.590">い</span><span begin="03:09.670" end="03:10.080">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是只能四处强颜欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">於是只能四處強顏歡笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So I keep putting on a friendly smile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서 애써 싹싹하게 굴고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors je distribue des sourires de façade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por eso reparto sonrisas de cortesía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Darum lächle ich allen gefällig zu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por isso distribuo sorrisos de fachada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поэтому я расточаю любезности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così dispenso sorrisi di circostanza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dakara aisou furimaite</span></p>
      <p begin="03:10.300" end="03:13.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="03:10.300" end="03:10.530">そ</span><span begin="03:10.530" end="03:10.730">れ</span><span begin="03:10.730" end="03:10.940">じゃ</span><span begin="03:10.940" end="03:11.170">気</span><span begin="03:11.170" end="03:11.590">持</span><span begin="03:11.590" end="03:11.800">ち</span><span begin="03:11.800" end="03:12.440">伝</span><span begin="03:12.440" end="03:12.570">わ</span><span begin="03:12.570" end="03:12.660">ん</span><span begin="03:12.660" end="03:12.920">な</span><span begin="03:12.920" end="03:13.110">い</span><span begin="03:13.110" end="03:13.500">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可这样终究无法传达心意呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可這樣終究無法傳達心意呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">But that won't get my feelings across will it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서는 마음이 전해지지 않겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais ainsi mes sentiments ne peuvent pas t'atteindre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero así mis sentimientos no llegan hasta ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch so kommen meine Gefühle nicht bei dir an</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas assim meus sentimentos não chegam até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но так мои чувства до тебя не дойдут</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma così i miei sentimenti non arrivano a te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore ja kimochi tsutawannai ne</span></p>
      <p begin="03:13.950" end="03:16.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="03:13.950" end="03:14.300">ああ</span> <span begin="03:14.380" end="03:14.580">ま</span><span begin="03:14.580" end="03:14.790">た</span><span begin="03:14.790" end="03:15.240">や</span><span begin="03:15.240" end="03:15.440">る</span><span begin="03:15.440" end="03:15.660">せ</span><span begin="03:15.660" end="03:15.910">な</span><span begin="03:15.910" end="03:16.310">い</span><span begin="03:16.310" end="03:16.780">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 又是这般无可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 又是這般無可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah here comes that helpless feeling again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 또다시 이 답답함만 남아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah encore cette amère impuissance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah otra vez esta amarga impotencia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ach wieder bleibt nur dieses Gefühl der Ohnmacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah mais uma vez essa angústia sem saída</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах снова эта безысходная тоска</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah di nuovo questa malinconia senza rimedio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa mata yarusenai ya</span></p>
      <p begin="03:17.150" end="03:23.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="03:17.150" end="03:17.680">今日</span><span begin="03:17.790" end="03:18.220">も</span><span begin="03:18.220" end="03:18.580">変</span><span begin="03:18.660" end="03:19.080">わ</span><span begin="03:19.080" end="03:19.510">ら</span><span begin="03:19.510" end="03:19.770">な</span><span begin="03:19.770" end="03:19.940">い</span><span begin="03:19.940" end="03:20.310">ま</span><span begin="03:20.400" end="03:23.410">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天也依旧一成不变</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">今天也依舊一成不變</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And today nothing has changed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오늘도 변함없는 채로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Aujourd'hui encore rien n'a changé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hoy todo sigue igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch heute bleibt alles unverändert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Hoje também tudo continua igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И сегодня всё без перемен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche oggi tutto rimane com'è</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kyou mo kawaranai mama</span></p>
      <p begin="03:23.800" end="03:24.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="03:23.800" end="03:24.300">あ</span><span begin="03:24.300" end="03:24.720">あ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ach</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa</span></p>
      <p begin="03:25.710" end="03:28.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="03:25.710" end="03:25.830">わ</span><span begin="03:25.910" end="03:26.410">か</span><span begin="03:26.410" end="03:26.800">ら</span><span begin="03:26.800" end="03:27.110">な</span><span begin="03:27.110" end="03:27.270">い</span><span begin="03:27.270" end="03:27.590">ま</span><span begin="03:27.730" end="03:28.750">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依然找不到答案</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">依然找不到答案</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Still without understanding</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여전히 알지 못한 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sans toujours rien comprendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigo sin comprender nada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Noch immer ohne es zu verstehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ainda sem compreender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так ничего и не понимая</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Senza ancora capire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wakaranai mama</span></p>
      <p begin="03:30.870" end="03:34.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="03:30.870" end="03:31.400">今日</span><span begin="03:31.510" end="03:31.930">も</span><span begin="03:31.930" end="03:32.280">変</span><span begin="03:32.360" end="03:32.780">わ</span><span begin="03:32.780" end="03:33.230">ら</span><span begin="03:33.230" end="03:33.490">な</span><span begin="03:33.490" end="03:33.660">い</span><span begin="03:33.660" end="03:34.000">ま</span><span begin="03:34.100" end="03:34.520">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天也依旧一成不变</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">今天也依舊一成不變</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And today nothing has changed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오늘도 변함없는 채로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Aujourd'hui encore rien n'a changé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hoy todo sigue igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch heute bleibt alles unverändert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Hoje também tudo continua igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И сегодня всё без перемен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche oggi tutto rimane com'è</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kyou mo kawaranai mama</span></p>
